  {
   "id": "da1306:T00197",
   "source_sha256": "c607514520907f7d7de5793ab9330fac681eee7519e0b7c43693f4efed7491f3",
   "ko": "「데몬베인!?」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da1306:T00198",
   "source_sha256": "eb0e723d959143cb73fdfe0d068bfe1b823ac0148d369add94d6199d14ffccf3",
   "ko": "「자, 말은 다 모였다!\n　게임의 시작이다!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da1306:T00199",
   "source_sha256": "62abb877500383eab35137051eba81dc7d9fdcadf6865ce7863cf71e0a9abc58",
   "ko": "「다이쥬지 쿠자쿠――그대는 "
  },
  {
   "id": "da1306:R00045",
   "source_sha256": "2a4bd3dd8cdae4a0d774af983c310bd518730d5e4f2b759f55c945fa20d416cd",
